{"path": "frontier/sources/i140_nonlinear_elliptic_discovery/snapshots/frontier__iterations__README.md", "sha256": "b06761da4d7bb4104267416537285e160b224616d6d7fc1660f14e08010faffb", "bytes": 401587, "start": 1596, "end": 1608, "total_lines": 1636, "passage_sha256": "b3bc5e1d93c9eba539e05fd9806d444858ca0306569768be3846abf09d8ea943", "ending": "[I137](iteration137-crystalline-coherence-task.json) receives the original direct brief, hash-bound complete recursive task record, full report and finalized parent response. It independently audits every original new paid assertion, then attempts coherent mesoscopic Gaussian strain/domain and renormalized long-range defect bounds with actual topology, scaling and boundary costs. I135 complex-analysis discovery and I136 birational-positivity discovery continue. **Eight substantial findings accepted; two remain.**", "convention": "UTF-8 splitlines; joined LF; no appended LF"}
